## Client Redirect Configuration

| Setting | Value |
|---------|-------|
| Connection Name | `{{ fg_name }}_CONN` |
| Primary Account | `{{ org }}.{{ source }}` |
| Failover Target | `{{ org }}.{{ target }}` |

After setup, all applications should use the **connection URL** (from `SHOW CONNECTIONS`) instead of direct account URLs.
